          bobResponse: 'Billing analysis complete.\n\n**Immediate action:**\nTerminate instances `gpu-train-01`, `gpu-train-02`, `gpu-train-03`. Estimated saving: ~$4,200/day.\n\n**Root cause:** Training jobs use a one-shot launch script with no teardown step. When the job finishes, the instance keeps running.\n\n**Prevention — three layers:**\n1. Add a `shutdown -h now` command at the end of every training script (immediate, free).\n2. Add a CloudWatch alarm: alert + auto-stop any GPU instance with CPU < 5% for > 2 hours (catches missed shutdowns).\n3. Add a monthly budget alert at 120% of the 3-month average — triggers before the next billing cycle catches it.\n\n**Cost recovery:** Tag all training instances with `project` and `job_id`. Enables per-project cost attribution going forward.',
